==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[short-circuit]]

===Etymology===
{{term|short}} + {{term|circuit}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# An [[unintentional]] [[connection]] of low [[resistance]] or [[impedance]] in a [[circuit]] such that [[excessive]] and often [[damaging]] [[current]] [[flow]]s in it.

